<div id="cap1" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="2.282" data-duration="2.326" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">First, don't order Vietnamese coffee.</div></div>
<div id="cap2" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="4.604" data-duration="2.512" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">One cup can easily become a daily ritual.</div></div>
<div id="cap3" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="7.205" data-duration="2.651" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">Second, don't wander the Old Quarter.</div></div>
<div id="cap4" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="9.852" data-duration="2.685" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">You might lose track of time in its little streets.</div></div>
<div id="cap5" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="12.568" data-duration="2.210" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">Third, don't stop for pho.</div></div>
<div id="cap6" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="14.809" data-duration="1.177" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">Before you finish,</div></div>
<div id="cap7" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="16.040" data-duration="2.511" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">you'll already be thinking about your next bowl.</div></div>
<div id="cap8" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="18.942" data-duration="3.325" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">Fourth, don't take a walk around Hoan Kiem Lake.</div></div>
<div id="cap9" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="22.263" data-duration="2.082" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">Your camera roll may never recover.</div></div>
<div id="cap10" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="24.469" data-duration="2.685" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">And finally, don't explore Hanoi</div></div>
<div id="cap11" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="27.104" data-duration="1.525" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">with a local photographer,</div></div>
<div id="cap12" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="28.718" data-duration="1.269" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">unless you want to take home</div></div>
<div id="cap13" class="clip cap-wrap" data-start="29.902" data-duration="1.954" data-track-index="2"><div class="caption">a story that feels like yours.</div></div>
